  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LOPEO Micro-credit Expansion</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Micro-credit.Beneficiaries: Women borrowers.The project funds will be used to expand LOPEO&apos;s loan fund and lending infrastructure; including an expanded office and training space; and add training in using LOPEO&apos;s loan software; Loan Performer. Further; the funds will put in place a system to provide for personal finance training to LOPEO&apos;s members.</narrative>
  </description>
